The workout was light. They were just pushing-ups, leg-lifting, abs, etc.#footnote[I referred to #link("https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6yd0_6UFhuA")[this video].] Once I finished, I would toss a coin into the Exercise cup. If I skipped it, the coin would go to the other one.

